Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. lunex_video (bundled binary)

   File: src/main/resources/assets/enderframelib/natives/lunex_video.dll
   A native video decoding library, shipped inside the mod jar and
   extracted at runtime by client/renderer/WebMediaManager.

   This is a prebuilt binary and is NOT covered by the LGPL-3.0 grant
   above. It is redistributed as a separate work; its own license terms
   apply to it. If you redistribute EnderFrameLib, carry this notice
   with it.

2. yt-dlp (downloaded at runtime, not bundled)

   Project: https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
   License: The Unlicense (public domain dedication)

   When a YouTube URL is used as a video source, WebMediaManager
   downloads the official yt-dlp release binary into the game directory
   and runs it as an external process to resolve the stream URL. The
   binary is fetched from the yt-dlp GitHub releases at first use; it is
   not distributed as part of this mod. No network download and no
   external process occurs unless a YouTube source is actually used.

   yt-dlp is released into the public domain under The Unlicense. See
   https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/blob/master/LICENSE for the text.

3. Java Native Access (JNA)

   Coordinates: net.java.dev.jna:jna, net.java.dev.jna:jna-platform
   License: dual-licensed under LGPL-2.1-or-later and Apache-2.0.
   Used to call into lunex_video. Resolved as an ordinary Maven
   dependency; not redistributed inside this repository.

